WEBVTT

00:07.341 --> 00:08.676
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.742 --> 00:10.311
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.378 --> 00:11.845
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:11.912 --> 00:14.014
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.082 --> 00:16.950
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.017 --> 00:18.919
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:18.986 --> 00:20.988
Kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.055 --> 00:22.632
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:22.656 --> 00:24.825
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.892 --> 00:26.960
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.027 --> 00:29.063
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.130 --> 00:31.007
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.031 --> 00:32.933
kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.000 --> 00:34.768
All:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:34.835 --> 00:37.105
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.171 --> 00:38.972
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.039 --> 00:40.341
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.408 --> 00:42.210
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.276 --> 00:44.978
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.045 --> 00:47.215
[flute plays]
[长笛演奏]

00:47.281 --> 00:48.949
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.819 --> 00:54.922
[light melodic music]
[轻快的旋律音乐]

00:54.988 --> 00:59.327
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:59.393 --> 01:01.895
[angry clamoring]
[愤怒的叫喊]

01:01.962 --> 01:04.432
- Huh?
- 啊？

01:07.868 --> 01:10.371
What's the meaning of this,
Mr. Squidward?
这句话有什么意义
章鱼哥先生？

01:10.438 --> 01:11.639
- Don't ask me.
- 别问我。

01:11.705 --> 01:13.607
Ask SpongeBob.
问海绵宝宝。

01:13.674 --> 01:16.344
- [vocalizing]
- [发声]

01:16.410 --> 01:17.978
- Hey, um, Mom, you don't need
- 嘿，嗯，妈妈，你不需要

01:18.045 --> 01:19.780
to cut the crust off
the Krabby Patty.
切掉外壳
蟹肉饼。

01:19.847 --> 01:22.116
Ha, we are making fast food.
哈，我们正在做快餐。

01:22.183 --> 01:24.385
- Love takes time, darling.
- 爱需要时间，亲爱的。

01:24.452 --> 01:27.655
Now hand me a tomato so I can
carve it into a rose garnish.
现在递给我一个西红柿，这样我就可以
将其雕刻成玫瑰装饰。

01:27.721 --> 01:28.822
- SpongeBob!
- 海绵宝宝！

01:28.889 --> 01:31.392
What in blue blazes
is going on in...
蓝色火焰里有什么
正在发生在...

01:31.459 --> 01:34.495
oh, hello, Mrs. SquarePants.
哦，你好，方裤夫人。

01:34.562 --> 01:36.664
- Well, hello, Eugene.
- 嗯，你好，尤金。

01:36.729 --> 01:40.268
I'm learning how
to make Krabby Patties.
我正在学习如何
制作蟹黄饼。

01:40.334 --> 01:42.503
- Oh, how lovely.
- 哦，多么可爱啊。

01:42.570 --> 01:45.406
Uh, may I borrow your son
for just a moment?
呃，我可以借用你的儿子吗
就一会儿？

01:45.473 --> 01:47.775
What is going on here, boy-o?
这是怎么回事，男孩？

01:47.841 --> 01:49.509
Why is your mother
in the kitchen?
为什么是你妈妈
在厨房里？

01:49.577 --> 01:51.812
Just take a look at that crowd!
只要看看那群人就知道了！

01:51.878 --> 01:55.015
- This is why I never go out
to eat anymore!
- 这就是我从不出门的原因
不再吃东西了！

01:55.082 --> 01:58.719
- Your mommy has no business
at my business.
- 你妈妈没闲事
在我的生意上。

01:58.786 --> 02:01.722
Send her home.
- Oh, but Mr. Krabs,
送她回家。
- 哦，但是蟹老板先生，

02:01.789 --> 02:04.225
the official employee calendar
says it's...
官方员工日历
说这是...

02:04.292 --> 02:06.360
Bring Your Mom to Work Day.
带你妈妈去上班日。

02:06.426 --> 02:08.762
- Ha, too bad I forgot.
- 哈，可惜我忘了。

02:08.829 --> 02:10.864
Boy, that would have been awful.
孩子，那真是太糟糕了。

02:10.931 --> 02:13.467
- Oh, it shivers me timbers
to think what a disaster
- 哦，它让我发抖
想想真是一场灾难

02:13.534 --> 02:15.636
my mom would make
if she was here.
我妈妈会做
如果她在这里的话。

02:15.703 --> 02:17.305
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

02:17.371 --> 02:20.741
- Ahem!
- 咳咳！

02:20.808 --> 02:23.877
- Don't you worry, fellas.
I invited your moms too.
- 别担心，伙计们。
我也邀请了你妈妈。

02:23.944 --> 02:25.145
- What?
- 什么？

02:25.213 --> 02:29.049
[strained] How thoughtful
of you, SpongeBob.
[紧张]想得真周到
你，海绵宝宝。

02:29.116 --> 02:30.918
- Well, we're here,
- 嗯，我们到了，

02:30.984 --> 02:34.454
so stop your horseplay
and show me what you do.
所以停止你的恶作剧吧
并告诉我你做了什么。

02:34.522 --> 02:36.790
- Mother, you're
embarrassing me.
- 妈妈，你是
让我难堪。

02:36.857 --> 02:38.459
Ow, ow, ow, ow!
- [chuckling]
噢，噢，噢，噢！
- [轻笑]

02:38.526 --> 02:40.328
[gasps]
[喘气]

02:40.394 --> 02:43.531
- I don't know what
you're chuckling about, Eugene.
- 我不知道什么
你在笑，尤金。

02:43.597 --> 02:47.268
There's wasted money
everywhere I look!
有浪费钱的
我到处看！

02:47.335 --> 02:48.869
[sizzles]
[嘶嘶声]

02:48.936 --> 02:52.673
When was the last time you
changed the oil in this fryer?
上次你是什么时候
换了这个炸锅里的油吗？

02:52.740 --> 02:55.042
- We change it every day, ma'am.
- 我们每天都会更换，女士。

02:55.108 --> 02:55.942
- Waste!
- 浪费！

02:56.009 --> 02:59.046
Should be but once a year.
每年应该只有一次。

02:59.112 --> 03:00.448
[sloshes]
[晃动]

03:00.514 --> 03:03.317
Real tomato ketchup.
Waste!
真正的番茄酱。
浪费！

03:03.384 --> 03:07.154
I bet in your latrine
you use two-ply toilet paper.
我打赌在你的厕所里
你使用两层卫生纸。

03:07.221 --> 03:09.923
- Ha, we use one-ply.
- 哈，我们用的是一层。

03:09.990 --> 03:13.594
- As if it grows on trees.
Waste!
- 就好像它长在树上一样。
浪费！

03:13.661 --> 03:15.563
It should be half-ply.
应该是半层的。

03:15.629 --> 03:17.130
Your profits
would be much higher
您的利润
会高得多

03:17.197 --> 03:19.400
if you stopped spending
willy-nilly.
如果你停止消费
无论愿意与否。

03:19.466 --> 03:21.134
- Yes, Mama.
- 是的，妈妈。

03:21.201 --> 03:23.504
- Remember to smile, son.
- 记得微笑，儿子。

03:23.571 --> 03:26.807
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

03:26.874 --> 03:28.709
- Where's my food?
- 我的食物在哪里？

03:28.776 --> 03:31.245
- I'm sorry for the delay, sir.
- 抱歉耽搁了，先生。

03:31.312 --> 03:33.914
Your order will be up soon.
您的订单很快就会完成。

03:33.981 --> 03:36.716
- I didn't say
lose your disdain.
-我没说
失去你的蔑视。

03:36.784 --> 03:38.852
- [growls]
- And don't slouch.
- [咆哮]
- 并且不要无精打采。

03:38.918 --> 03:40.588
You'll ruin your spine.
你会毁掉你的脊椎。

03:40.654 --> 03:44.156
- I'm an invertebrate, Mother!
- 我是无脊椎动物，妈妈！

03:44.224 --> 03:45.692
- And no back talk.
- 并且没有顶嘴。

03:45.759 --> 03:47.661
- Yes, Mother.
- 是的，妈妈。

03:47.728 --> 03:49.062
- Nice disdain.
- 很好的蔑视。

03:49.129 --> 03:52.766
But save it for the customers.
- [sighs]
但还是留给顾客吧。
- [叹气]

03:52.833 --> 03:55.035
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

03:55.102 --> 03:58.038
Order up for Old Man Jenkins.
为老詹金斯订购。

03:58.105 --> 04:00.441
One Krabby Patty
with crust removed
一份蟹肉饼
去除外壳

04:00.508 --> 04:02.476
and one side salad.
和一份沙拉。

04:02.543 --> 04:05.012
- I ordered fries, not a salad.
- 我点了薯条，不是沙拉。

04:05.078 --> 04:08.248
- The fries are in the salad.
- 薯条在沙拉里。

04:08.316 --> 04:10.551
- Okay, I'll try it.
- 好吧，我会尝试一下。

04:10.618 --> 04:13.287
But only 'cause I'm so hungry.
但只是因为我太饿了。

04:13.353 --> 04:15.389
[chomps]
[咀嚼]

04:15.456 --> 04:17.425
Aha!
[all gasp]
啊哈！
[全都喘气]

04:17.491 --> 04:20.994
It reminds me of my mother's
cooking when I was but a boy.
这让我想起了我母亲的
我小时候做饭。

04:21.060 --> 04:24.365
I'm filled with childish glee!
我心里充满了童趣！

04:24.432 --> 04:27.435
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

04:27.501 --> 04:30.638
- Mm.
- 毫米。

04:30.704 --> 04:33.841
- I made everyone's orders.
- 我下达了每个人的命令。

04:33.907 --> 04:36.677
- Huh?
- [laughs]
- 啊？
- [笑]

04:36.744 --> 04:40.481
- My mom doesn't understand
fast food... not the way I do.
- 我妈妈不明白
快餐...不是我的方式。

04:40.548 --> 04:45.252
Her cooking takes forever,
because she adds love.
她的烹饪需要很长时间，
因为她增添了爱。

04:45.319 --> 04:49.390
- You mean there's no love
in this Krabby Patty?
- 你的意思是没有爱
在这个蟹肉饼里？

04:49.457 --> 04:52.225
Now all I taste is the fast.
现在我只尝到了斋戒的滋味。

04:52.292 --> 04:54.261
I demand a refund!
我要求退款！

04:54.328 --> 04:55.639
- Give me some love.
- Yeah, me too!
- 给我一些爱。
- 是的，我也是！

04:55.663 --> 04:57.931
[angry clamoring]
[愤怒的叫喊]

04:57.998 --> 04:59.633
- Okay, that's enough.
- 好吧，够了。

04:59.700 --> 05:01.769
There'll be no refunds.
不会有退款。

05:01.835 --> 05:04.738
You see, there is love here.
你看，这里有爱。

05:04.805 --> 05:07.341
My love for your money.
[heart thumping]
我对你的钱的爱。
[心跳]

05:07.408 --> 05:08.709
Mwah.
哇。

05:08.776 --> 05:11.244
You don't want
to break us up, do ya?
你不想要
来拆散我们，是吗？

05:11.311 --> 05:15.849
- Give me my money back!
- Where's the love?
- 把钱还给我！
- 爱在哪里？

05:15.916 --> 05:19.387
[screeching]
[all groan]
[尖叫声]
[全都呻吟]

05:19.453 --> 05:22.723
- Clearly, our sons aren't
working hard enough.
- 显然，我们的儿子不是
工作足够努力。

05:22.790 --> 05:27.628
Believe me when I say no one
is more disappointed than we,
当我说没有人时请相信我
比我们更失望的是

05:27.695 --> 05:29.229
their mothers.
他们的母亲。

05:29.296 --> 05:30.731
- We thought
we taught them better.
- 我们以为
我们教得更好。

05:30.798 --> 05:32.400
- To avert this disaster,
- 为了避免这场灾难，

05:32.466 --> 05:34.067
we're going
to take over the restaurant
我们要去
接管餐厅

05:34.134 --> 05:36.069
and show our boys how it's done.
并向我们​​的孩子们展示这是如何做到的。

05:36.136 --> 05:38.739
- But Mama!
- Zip it!
- 但是妈妈！
- 拉上拉链！

05:38.806 --> 05:41.174
And to the shame corner
with you three.
到羞耻的角落
和你们三个。

05:41.241 --> 05:43.777
All: Aww.
全体：哇。

05:43.844 --> 05:48.849
- Now time to spruce
this place up.
- 现在是时候修剪一下了
这个地方起来。

05:48.916 --> 05:51.985
- "Mama Krabs
Home-style Cooking"?
- “蟹妈妈
家庭式烹饪”？

05:52.052 --> 05:54.254
This is gonna be a disaster.
这将是一场灾难。

05:54.321 --> 05:56.957
Look at what they did
to me restaurant.
看看他们做了什么
给我的餐厅。

05:57.024 --> 05:59.126
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

05:59.192 --> 06:01.261
- I think the place looks homey.
- 我觉得这个地方看起来很温馨。

06:01.328 --> 06:04.598
- If I wanted "homey,"
I'd stay at home.
- 如果我想要“温馨”
我会呆在家里。

06:04.665 --> 06:07.167
This is costing me a fortune.
[cash register dings]
这让我损失了一大笔钱。
[收银机叮叮声]

06:07.234 --> 06:09.570
- Actually, Mrs. SquarePants
had all this stuff
- 事实上，方裤夫人
拥有所有这些东西

06:09.637 --> 06:11.038
in the trunk of her boat.
在她的船的后备箱里。

06:11.104 --> 06:14.508
- A mother is always prepared.
- 母亲总是做好准备。

06:14.575 --> 06:17.678
- Eventually, our moms
will crash and burn.
- 最终，我们的妈妈
会崩溃并燃烧。

06:17.745 --> 06:21.482
And then we'll reclaim
the Krusty Krab.
然后我们会回收
蟹堡王。

06:21.549 --> 06:23.984
- Looks like it's gonna happen
sooner than later.
- 看来这会发生
宜早不宜迟。

06:24.051 --> 06:26.319
Look who just arrived.
看看谁刚到。

06:26.386 --> 06:29.389
- [grunts grotesquely]
- Bubble Bass.
- [怪诞地咕哝]
- 泡泡鲈鱼。

06:29.457 --> 06:31.559
- Every mom's nightmare.
- 每个妈妈的噩梦。

06:31.625 --> 06:35.496
- Bubby, you forgot your doll
on the boat.
- 巴比，你忘记带娃娃了
在船上。

06:35.563 --> 06:36.897
- Mom!
- 妈妈！

06:36.964 --> 06:40.267
It's an action figure,
not a doll.
这是一个动作人物，
不是洋娃娃。

06:40.332 --> 06:42.002
- We're doomed.
- 我们注定了。

06:42.069 --> 06:43.904
- Welcome to Mama Krabs'.
- 欢迎来到蟹妈妈家。

06:43.971 --> 06:47.475
Right this way.
- [grumbles]
就这样。
- [抱怨]

06:47.541 --> 06:49.276
- Here's your menus.
- 这是你的菜单。

06:49.342 --> 06:50.478
- Interesting.
- 有趣的。

06:50.544 --> 06:53.046
We shall see if
this new management
我们将看看是否
这个新的管理

06:53.113 --> 06:55.916
can stand up to my scrutiny.
经得起我的推敲。

06:55.983 --> 06:58.251
I will have one of every...
huh?
我每样都会有一个...
嗯？

06:58.318 --> 06:59.487
Ow!
噢！

06:59.553 --> 07:02.189
- We'll both have
the early-bird special.
- 我们都会有
早鸟特惠。

07:02.255 --> 07:05.726
- Mother,
I'm going to get a soda.
- 妈妈，
我要去买一瓶苏打水。

07:05.793 --> 07:07.861
[exclaims]
[惊呼]

07:09.763 --> 07:12.365
[hums happily]
[高兴地哼哼]

07:12.432 --> 07:15.135
Hmm?
[yelps]
唔？
[尖叫声]

07:15.202 --> 07:17.538
Mom!
妈妈！

07:17.605 --> 07:19.072
- Soda straws are dangerous.
- 苏打水吸管很危险。

07:19.139 --> 07:20.941
You'll put your eye out.
你会把你的眼睛挖出来。

07:21.008 --> 07:22.976
Use this instead.
- [gasps]
用这个代替。
- [喘气]

07:23.043 --> 07:25.546
Ooh! Ga-ga.
哦！嘎嘎。

07:25.613 --> 07:29.750
I mean, uh, so embarrassing.
我的意思是，呃，太尴尬了。

07:29.817 --> 07:30.817
[burps]
[打嗝]

07:30.851 --> 07:32.352
- Here you go.
- 干得好。

07:32.419 --> 07:34.855
- Ooh.
- Two Krabby Patty casseroles.
- 哦。
- 两份蟹肉饼砂锅菜。

07:34.922 --> 07:37.257
I even cut it
into bite-sized pieces.
我还把它剪掉了
切成一口大小的碎片。

07:37.324 --> 07:40.694
- That's just how
my boy likes it.
- 就是这样
我的男孩喜欢它。

07:40.761 --> 07:43.531
- Enjoy!
- 享受！

07:45.132 --> 07:47.868
- Of course that mama's boy
would like it here.
- 当然是妈妈的儿子
会喜欢这里的。

07:47.935 --> 07:50.270
- Uh, guys, look!
- 呃，伙计们，看！

07:50.337 --> 07:52.906
It seems like everyone
is liking it here.
看来大家
很喜欢这里。

07:52.973 --> 07:56.076
[contented chatter]
[心满意足的闲聊]

08:00.981 --> 08:03.450
- You've got some smudge.
- 你身上有一些污迹。

08:03.517 --> 08:05.052
- Danke.
- 丹克。

08:05.118 --> 08:06.820
- I don't believe it.
- 我不相信。

08:06.887 --> 08:08.221
They're a success.
他们是成功的。

08:08.288 --> 08:09.623
- Well, of course they are.
- 嗯，当然是。

08:09.690 --> 08:11.158
Look how hard they're working.
看看他们有多努力。

08:11.224 --> 08:13.093
- I actually feel kind of guilty
- 我其实感到有点内疚

08:13.160 --> 08:16.363
seeing them do all the work.
看到他们做所有的工作。

08:16.429 --> 08:17.665
- How pathetic.
- 多么可悲啊。

08:17.731 --> 08:21.301
You three clearly don't know
how to appreciate
你们三个显然不知道
如何欣赏

08:21.368 --> 08:25.205
the smothering embrace
of motherly love.
令人窒息的拥抱
的母爱。

08:25.272 --> 08:29.309
- And what do you suggest?
- 你有什么建议？

08:29.376 --> 08:34.481
- Are these premises equipped
with a basement?
- 这些场所是否配备齐全
有地下室吗？

08:34.548 --> 08:36.683
- All right, here we are.
- 好吧，我们到了。

08:36.750 --> 08:40.721
- Gentlemen, I present
the fortress of solitude
- 先生们，我介绍
孤独的堡垒

08:40.788 --> 08:44.357
for adult children.
对于成年儿童。

08:44.424 --> 08:46.927
- It's a junk-filled basement.
- 这是一个堆满垃圾的地下室。

08:46.994 --> 08:49.429
- Oh, you see junk.
- 哦，你看到垃圾了。

08:49.496 --> 08:52.399
I see...
我懂了...

08:52.465 --> 08:53.533
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

08:53.601 --> 08:55.535
A hangout lounge!
一个聚会休息室！

08:55.603 --> 08:57.004
- Correct.
- 正确的。

08:57.070 --> 08:59.472
- Well, it's better
than the shame corner.
- 嗯，这样更好了
比羞耻角。

08:59.539 --> 09:00.674
- I guess.
- 我猜。

09:00.741 --> 09:02.843
- Down here,
you can spend your time
- 在这里，
你可以花时间

09:02.910 --> 09:04.578
doing whatever you want.
做你想做的事。

09:04.645 --> 09:07.480
Reading comics,
playing video games,
看漫画，
玩电子游戏，

09:07.547 --> 09:10.083
complaining on the Internet.
[dolphin chirps]
在网上抱怨。
[海豚鸣叫声]

09:10.150 --> 09:12.285
- Your life choices are lame,
- 你的人生选择是蹩脚的，

09:12.352 --> 09:14.955
but I like the overall concept.
但我喜欢整体概念。

09:15.022 --> 09:17.290
- And with your mother upstairs,
- 你妈妈在楼上，

09:17.357 --> 09:20.193
snacks are just a holler away.
小吃距离酒店仅一步之遥。

09:20.260 --> 09:22.663
- Ooh, my mom loves
to make snacks.
- 哦，我妈妈喜欢
做零食。

09:22.730 --> 09:23.964
What else can you teach us,
你还能教我们什么

09:24.031 --> 09:27.267
oh wise sage
of the slacker ways?
噢，明智的圣人
比较懒惰的方法？

09:27.334 --> 09:30.704
- Alas, my time with you is
at an end.
- 唉，我和你在一起的时间是
在结束时。

09:30.771 --> 09:34.107
I have been a good boy,
and my mother is taking me
我一直是个好孩子
我妈妈带着我

09:34.174 --> 09:38.612
for ice cream
in three, two, one.
用于冰淇淋
三、二、一。

09:38.679 --> 09:41.081
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

09:41.148 --> 09:43.917
I'm ready for my ice cream,
Mommy.
我已经准备好吃冰淇淋了
妈妈。

09:43.984 --> 09:45.352
- Bye, girls!
- 再见，女孩们！

09:45.418 --> 09:48.121
- Come back soon, you hear.
- 快点回来，你听到了。

09:48.188 --> 09:50.790
- Well, I guess
we can give it a try.
- 嗯，我想
我们可以尝试一下。

09:50.858 --> 09:54.061
[clears throat]
Mo-om!
[清嗓子]
唷唷！

09:54.127 --> 09:57.230
[8-bit sounds and music]
[8位声音和音乐]

09:59.266 --> 10:03.236
- [grumbles]
- [laughs]
- [抱怨]
- [笑]

10:05.105 --> 10:09.242
Mom, nachos!
妈妈，玉米片！

10:09.309 --> 10:11.278
[laughs]
- [groans]
[笑]
- [呻吟]

10:11.344 --> 10:13.280
- [laughs]
- Hey, watch the fort!
- [笑]
- 嘿，注意堡垒！

10:13.346 --> 10:15.215
- Mom!
- Ma!
- 妈妈！
- 妈！

10:15.282 --> 10:17.050
- Mom!
- Mom!
- 妈妈！
- 妈妈！

10:17.117 --> 10:19.086
- Mom!
- Mom!
- 妈妈！
- 妈妈！

10:19.152 --> 10:21.521
- Mom.
- Mom!
- 妈妈。
- 妈妈！

10:21.588 --> 10:23.991
- Hey, Ma!
- 嘿，妈妈！

10:27.460 --> 10:30.130
[sleepy murmurs]
- Mommy, Mommy.
[困倦的低语]
- 妈妈，妈妈。

10:30.197 --> 10:33.033
- Mommy, Mommy, Mommy.
- Mommy, Mommy, Mommy.
- 妈妈，妈妈，妈妈。
- 妈妈，妈妈，妈妈。

10:33.100 --> 10:36.569
- I've never slept better
in me life.
- 我从来没有睡得这么好过
在我的生活中。

10:36.636 --> 10:40.107
Last night made me feel
like a kid again.
昨晚让我感觉
又像个孩子了。

10:40.173 --> 10:42.542
- [exhales]
So that's what it's like
- [呼气]
所以就是这样的

10:42.609 --> 10:44.311
to have a childhood.
拥有一个童年。

10:44.377 --> 10:46.714
- Aww, you guys are
the best buddies
- 哇，你们是
最好的朋友

10:46.780 --> 10:47.881
a kid could ever have.
一个孩子可能会拥有。

10:47.948 --> 10:49.649
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

10:49.717 --> 10:50.984
- I'm hungry.
- 我饿了。

10:51.051 --> 10:53.721
Mom, breakfast!
妈妈，早餐啦！

10:53.787 --> 10:55.789
[crickets chirp]
[蟋蟀鸣叫]

10:57.324 --> 10:59.392
- Guys, I think
something's wrong.
- 伙计们，我想
出问题了。

10:59.459 --> 11:01.795
- Agreed, lad.
We better go check.
- 同意，小伙子。
我们最好去检查一下。

11:01.862 --> 11:04.031
[grunting, laughter]
[咕哝声、笑声]

11:04.097 --> 11:06.533
- Oh, yeah.
- 哦，是的。

11:06.599 --> 11:08.368
[relaxed chatter]
[轻松的闲聊]

11:08.435 --> 11:11.571
- [snickers]
- Booyah!
- [窃笑]
- 嘘！

11:11.638 --> 11:14.641
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

11:14.708 --> 11:16.877
- What in tarnation?
- 塔尼翁什么？

11:16.944 --> 11:18.746
Who are these bums?
这些流浪汉是谁？

11:18.812 --> 11:20.247
- Hey, kids.
- 嘿，孩子们。

11:20.313 --> 11:22.282
- Oh, there you are, Eugene.
- 哦，你来了，尤金。

11:22.349 --> 11:24.184
Go fix me one of
those Krabbity Patties
去给我修一个
那些蟹肉饼

11:24.251 --> 11:25.819
you're always going on about.
你总是喋喋不休。

11:25.886 --> 11:27.120
All: Dad?
全体：爸爸？

11:27.187 --> 11:29.222
- Oh!
- 哦！

11:29.289 --> 11:30.457
That's right.
这是正确的。

11:30.523 --> 11:33.593
Today is Bring Your Dad
to Work Day.
今天带你爸爸来
到工作日。

11:33.660 --> 11:37.097
- Oh, uh, while you're up, son,
could you refill my drink?
- 哦，呃，当你起床的时候，儿子，
你能给我续杯吗？

11:37.164 --> 11:39.399
- And more chips for me, kid.
- 还有更多筹码给我，孩子。

11:39.466 --> 11:44.237
- Any time you're ready with
that Krabbity Patty, son.
- 任何时候你准备好
克拉比蒂·帕蒂，儿子。

11:44.304 --> 11:48.540
- I want my mommy.
- [whimpers]
- 我想要我的妈妈。
- [呜咽]

11:51.644 --> 11:54.581
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

11:54.647 --> 12:00.087
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:00.153 --> 12:03.323
- I'm glad you can come
to the pet park today, Patrick.
- 我很高兴你能来
今天去宠物公园，帕特里克。

12:03.390 --> 12:06.459
- [muffled muttering]
- [低声嘀咕]

12:06.526 --> 12:08.461
Well, thanks for inviting me.
嗯，谢谢你邀请我。

12:08.528 --> 12:11.598
I can't wait
to see Gary's new tricks!
我等不及了
来看看Gary的新花样吧！

12:11.664 --> 12:15.568
- [meowing]
- [喵喵叫]

12:15.635 --> 12:17.637
- There's nothing more fun
than bringing your pet
- 没有什么比这更好玩的了
比带你的宠物

12:17.704 --> 12:18.972
to a pet park.
去宠物公园。

12:19.039 --> 12:21.508
- SpongeBob!
- 海绵宝宝！

12:24.344 --> 12:25.879
[laughs maniacally]
[疯狂地笑]

12:25.946 --> 12:29.149
I got one of those head things!
我得到了其中一件这样的东西！

12:29.216 --> 12:30.650
- A concussion?
- 脑震荡？

12:30.717 --> 12:32.085
- Yeah.
- 是的。

12:32.152 --> 12:33.921
But also the other thing.
但还有另一件事。

12:33.987 --> 12:35.688
- Oh, a thought.
- 哦，一个想法。

12:35.755 --> 12:39.126
- Yeah, I think
I'd like to have my own pet
- 是的，我想
我想拥有自己的宠物

12:39.192 --> 12:40.928
to bring to the pet park.
带到宠物公园。

12:40.994 --> 12:43.196
- That's a great idea.
- 这是个好主意。

12:43.263 --> 12:46.266
We can stop at the pet store
on the way.
我们可以在宠物店停下来
在路上。

12:46.333 --> 12:49.769
Mm, do any of these pets
pique your fancy?
嗯，养这些宠物吗
激怒你的幻想吗？

12:49.837 --> 12:51.204
- No.
- 不。

12:51.271 --> 12:53.073
Uh-uh. Nope.
呃呃。没有。

12:53.140 --> 12:54.842
Whoa!
哇！

12:54.908 --> 12:57.811
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

12:57.878 --> 13:00.013
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

13:00.080 --> 13:01.614
That one!
那个！

13:01.681 --> 13:05.252
I want that one!
That's the pet for me!
我想要那个！
这就是我的宠物！

13:09.256 --> 13:10.757
- Huh.
- 嗯。

13:10.824 --> 13:13.994
All right, go on through.
好吧，继续吧。

13:14.061 --> 13:15.695
Hold it right there!
就稳住那儿吧！

13:15.762 --> 13:18.866
I'm gonna need
to see some proof of pet.
我将需要
查看宠物的一些证明。

13:18.932 --> 13:21.935
- Of course.
- 当然。

13:22.002 --> 13:23.403
- That's a rock.
- 那是一块石头。

13:23.470 --> 13:26.373
- Yeah.
His name is Rolly.
- 是的。
他的名字叫罗利。

13:26.439 --> 13:28.675
- I don't see how
this thing is a pet.
- 我不明白怎么办
这东西是宠物。

13:28.741 --> 13:30.743
- Oh, here.
Take a closer look.
- 哦，在这里。
仔细看看。

13:32.645 --> 13:34.181
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

13:34.247 --> 13:36.917
Oh, yes. He's adorable.
哦是的。他很可爱。

13:36.984 --> 13:38.818
Go right in.
向右进去。

13:38.886 --> 13:40.020
- Thanks.
[laughs]
- 谢谢。
[笑]

13:40.087 --> 13:41.321
Come on, Rolly.
来吧，罗利。

13:41.388 --> 13:43.623
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

13:45.092 --> 13:47.460
- [neighs]
- [嘶嘶声]

13:51.064 --> 13:52.165
- Wow.
- 哇。

13:52.232 --> 13:56.036
Yup, that's my card.
- [laughs]
是的，那是我的卡。
- [笑]

13:56.103 --> 13:59.006
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

13:59.072 --> 14:01.008
Rolly, Rolly, Rolly!
罗利，罗利，罗利！

14:01.074 --> 14:03.576
[winces, laughs]
[畏缩，大笑]

14:03.643 --> 14:05.212
- Oh.
- 哦。

14:05.278 --> 14:07.847
Geode hunting is
a cracking good time.
晶洞狩猎是
一段美好的时光。

14:07.915 --> 14:09.082
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

14:09.149 --> 14:10.650
Ooh, ha ha!
哦，哈哈！

14:10.717 --> 14:13.220
The perfect crystal
quartz lattice.
完美的水晶
石英晶格。

14:13.286 --> 14:17.757
An exquisite specimen
for my collection.
精美的标本
为了我的收藏。

14:17.824 --> 14:20.260
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

14:20.327 --> 14:23.030
- Rolly, you're
the best rock ever.
- 罗利，你是
有史以来最好的摇滚。

14:23.096 --> 14:24.764
- What the devil?
- 什么鬼？

14:24.831 --> 14:27.767
By Jove.
乔夫。

14:27.834 --> 14:29.536
Such majesty.
如此威严。

14:29.602 --> 14:32.272
That must have quite the geode
inside.
那一定有相当大的晶洞
里面。

14:32.339 --> 14:33.573
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

14:33.640 --> 14:36.243
- [laughs]
- Tallyho, good chap.
- [笑]
- 塔利霍，好小伙子。

14:36.309 --> 14:37.810
Whoa!
哇！

14:37.877 --> 14:42.149
Perciful Rockhound,
amateur geode enthusiast.
敏锐的岩石猎犬，
业余晶洞爱好者。

14:42.215 --> 14:43.783
- You talk funny.
- 你说话很有趣。

14:43.850 --> 14:45.252
[giggles]
Huh?
[咯咯笑]
啊？

14:45.318 --> 14:47.187
What? What's that, Rolly?
什么？那是什么，罗利？

14:47.254 --> 14:48.855
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

14:48.922 --> 14:52.059
Rolly says he wants
to play with you.
罗利说他想要
和你一起玩。

14:52.125 --> 14:53.626
Here you go.
干得好。

14:53.693 --> 14:55.462
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

14:55.528 --> 14:58.298
- Have fun, you two.
- 玩得开心，你们两个。

14:59.967 --> 15:01.401
- Ooh.
- Wow.
- 哦。
- 哇。

15:01.468 --> 15:03.303
- Hey, Patrick. Where's Rolly?
- 嘿，帕特里克。罗利在哪里？

15:03.370 --> 15:07.174
- Oh, he's playing with the
funny mustache man over there.
- 哦，他正在玩
那边有有趣的小胡子男人。

15:07.240 --> 15:10.277
- [muffled muttering]
- [低声嘀咕]

15:10.343 --> 15:11.343
[grunts]
[咕哝]

15:11.378 --> 15:13.146
- Oh, so cute.
- 噢，真可爱。

15:13.213 --> 15:17.917
But that's enough play, Rolly.
但玩够了，罗利。

15:17.985 --> 15:20.287
- [yelps]
- [gasps]
- [尖叫声]
- [喘气]

15:20.353 --> 15:24.924
- Whoa, whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa, whoa!
- 哇，哇，哇，
哇，哇，哇！

15:24.992 --> 15:26.626
Whoa, Rolly!
哇，罗利！

15:26.693 --> 15:31.731
You want to play
with everyone today.
你想玩
今天和大家一起。

15:33.466 --> 15:35.002
Done already?
已经完成了吗？

15:35.068 --> 15:37.437
Oh, who's a good boy?
哦，谁是好孩子？

15:37.504 --> 15:41.374
- Uh, Patrick,
maybe we should leave.
- 呃，帕特里克，
也许我们应该离开。

15:41.441 --> 15:43.410
- Good idea, SpongeBob.
- 好主意，海绵宝宝。

15:43.476 --> 15:46.113
Everybody here is
sleeping anyway.
这里的每个人都是
反正睡觉。

15:46.179 --> 15:49.782
Come on, Rolly!
加油，罗利！

15:49.849 --> 15:52.719
- I will tear that rock asunder.
- 我会把那块岩石撕成碎片。

15:52.785 --> 15:55.989
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

15:56.056 --> 15:57.457
- What a fun day.
- 多么有趣的一天啊。

15:57.524 --> 16:01.194
Now it's time to do
my favorite thing...
现在是时候做
我最喜欢的东西...

16:01.261 --> 16:03.696
nothing!
没有什么！

16:03.763 --> 16:04.764
[chuckles]
[笑声]

16:04.831 --> 16:08.568
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

16:08.635 --> 16:13.306
- It's the "Sir Urchin
& Snail Fail Show."
- 这是“顽童先生”
＆蜗牛失败秀。”

16:13.373 --> 16:15.575
- [laughs]
- Why, you!
- [笑]
- 为什么，你！

16:15.642 --> 16:17.677
- What'd I do?
- 我做了什么？

16:22.349 --> 16:25.485
- [guffaws]
- [大笑]

16:35.195 --> 16:36.396
[phone beeping]
[电话嘟嘟声]

16:36.463 --> 16:39.432
- [meows]
- [喵]

16:39.499 --> 16:40.967
[phone rings]
[电话铃声]

16:41.034 --> 16:42.735
- SquarePants residence.
- 方裤住宅。

16:42.802 --> 16:45.805
- Oh, SpongeBob.
I don't think Rolly likes TV.
- 哦，海绵宝宝。
我认为罗利不喜欢电视。

16:45.872 --> 16:48.208
[Gary chomping]
He tore up the place.
[加里咀嚼]
他撕毁了这个地方。

16:48.275 --> 16:49.609
- Have you been feeding him?
- 你喂过他吗？

16:49.676 --> 16:52.179
Pets get cranky
if they don't get their food.
宠物脾气暴躁
如果他们没有得到食物。

16:52.245 --> 16:54.013
- Oh, yeah! Oh.
- 哦，是的！哦。

16:54.081 --> 16:55.782
Thanks, buddy.
谢谢，伙计。

16:55.848 --> 16:56.915
- Of course.
- 当然。

16:56.983 --> 16:58.485
- Rolly!
- 罗利！

16:58.551 --> 17:02.855
SpongeBob said you need lots
of food.
海绵宝宝说你需要很多
食物。

17:02.922 --> 17:07.127
Good thing I had this big bag
of cement mix on hand.
还好我有这么大的包
手头的水泥混合物。

17:10.029 --> 17:12.531
Just add water.
只需加水即可。

17:12.598 --> 17:15.402
Huh. Okay.
呵呵。好的。

17:17.670 --> 17:21.141
Bone apple teeth, Rolly.
骨苹果牙，罗利。

17:21.208 --> 17:24.577
Now it's time for my lunch.
现在该吃午饭了。

17:26.246 --> 17:28.047
[vacuum whirs]
[真空呼呼声]

17:28.115 --> 17:29.949
I like it dry.
我喜欢干的。

17:30.016 --> 17:32.152
Huh? Whoa!
啊？哇！

17:32.219 --> 17:37.224
Rolly, you got big.
罗利，你长大了。

17:37.290 --> 17:39.459
SpongeBob?
- Yes?
海绵宝宝？
- 是的？

17:39.526 --> 17:43.062
- I fed Rolly, and he got big!
- 我喂了罗利，他长大了！

17:43.130 --> 17:44.297
Is he dying?
他快死了吗？

17:44.364 --> 17:45.765
- No, you silly.
- 不，你这个傻瓜。

17:45.832 --> 17:48.067
He probably just needs a walk
to go potty.
他可能只是需要散步
去上厕所。

17:48.135 --> 17:50.237
But make sure
he wears his leash.
但请确保
他戴着皮带。

17:50.303 --> 17:52.405
- Okay!
- 好的！

17:52.472 --> 17:55.275
Time for a walk, Rolly.
是时候去散步了，罗利。

17:55.342 --> 17:57.944
The world is your toilet.
世界就是你的厕所。

17:58.010 --> 18:00.813
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

18:00.880 --> 18:02.182
My word.
我的话。

18:02.249 --> 18:04.917
How rotund his rock has grown.
他的石头长得多圆啊。

18:04.984 --> 18:08.455
I must pilfer that plump pebble.
我必须偷走那块肥美的鹅卵石。

18:08.521 --> 18:11.090
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

18:11.158 --> 18:13.360
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

18:13.426 --> 18:15.462
- Aah!
- 啊啊！

18:15.528 --> 18:17.630
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

18:19.999 --> 18:21.434
- Ooh!
- 哦！

18:21.501 --> 18:23.636
What stinks?
[squelch]
什么臭？
[静噪]

18:23.703 --> 18:26.005
Oh, it's you, Rolly.
哦，是你，罗莉。

18:27.974 --> 18:31.611
Hmm, what am I supposed to do?
嗯，我该怎么办？

18:31.678 --> 18:33.413
[beeping, line trilling]
[嘟嘟声，线路颤音]

18:33.480 --> 18:34.681
Hi, SpongeBob.
嗨，海绵宝宝。

18:34.747 --> 18:36.283
- Hey, Patrick.
- 嘿，帕特里克。

18:36.349 --> 18:37.584
- Ma-mow.
- 妈妈。

18:37.650 --> 18:39.018
- [sniffs, strains]
- [嗅、拉]

18:39.085 --> 18:41.588
Rolly smells like garbage water.
罗利闻起来像垃圾水。

18:41.654 --> 18:43.156
Is he mad at me?
他生我的气吗？

18:43.223 --> 18:44.957
- Of course not.
- 当然不是。

18:45.024 --> 18:47.394
You can take him to a groomer
to freshen him up.
你可以带他去美容师那里
让他精神焕发。

18:47.460 --> 18:50.029
- Oh? Huh.
- 哦？呵呵。

18:50.096 --> 18:53.566
Conveniently Placed
Rock Groomer.
位置方便
岩石美容师。

18:53.633 --> 18:55.735
There's one right here!
这里就有一个！

18:55.802 --> 18:58.037
Thanks, SpongeBob.
谢谢，海绵宝宝。

18:58.104 --> 18:59.172
[chomps]
[咀嚼]

18:59.239 --> 19:00.307
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

19:00.373 --> 19:04.511
[groans]
Hmm?
[呻吟]
嗯？

19:04.577 --> 19:05.678
- Good day, sir.
- Huh?
- 美好的一天，先生。
- 啊？

19:05.745 --> 19:08.315
- [snickers]
- [窃笑]

19:08.381 --> 19:10.116
I'm the rock groomer.
我是岩石美容师。

19:10.183 --> 19:15.188
May I take that ample, glorious
collectible rock from you?
我可以接受那充足、光荣的
您的收藏岩石？

19:15.255 --> 19:16.256
Whoa!
哇！

19:16.323 --> 19:19.025
- Rolly needs a bath.
- 罗利需要洗澡。

19:19.091 --> 19:22.028
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

19:23.996 --> 19:26.233
- Aah!
- 啊啊！

19:29.135 --> 19:31.938
At last, the glimmering contents
最后，闪烁的内容

19:32.004 --> 19:36.142
of your sturdy aspects
shall be mine.
你坚强的方面
将是我的。

19:36.209 --> 19:39.178
[growls]
[咆哮]

19:39.246 --> 19:41.681
Huh? Aah, aah!
啊？啊啊啊！

19:41.748 --> 19:43.616
Oh, no! Back, you beast!
哦，不！回来吧，你这个畜生！

19:43.683 --> 19:46.519
Ow! Ow!
噢！噢！

19:46.586 --> 19:48.888
- Oh, finished already?
- 哦，已经结束了吗？

19:48.955 --> 19:50.623
Wow!
哇！

19:50.690 --> 19:53.226
Rolly, you're beautiful!
罗莉，你真美！

19:53.293 --> 19:55.895
I've gotta tell SpongeBob.
我得告诉海绵宝宝。

19:57.664 --> 19:59.232
- Hi again.
- 又嗨了。

19:59.299 --> 20:02.669
- SpongeBob, Rolly
looks prettier than,
- 海绵宝宝、罗利
看起来比,更漂亮

20:02.735 --> 20:06.205
um, a really pretty thing.
嗯，非常漂亮的东西。

20:06.273 --> 20:07.874
You gotta see him.
你一定要见他。

20:07.940 --> 20:09.051
- Well, you should
bring him down
- 嗯，你应该
把他打倒

20:09.075 --> 20:11.177
to the Bikini Bottom Pet Show.
参加比基尼宠物秀。

20:11.244 --> 20:13.613
Gary and I are here now.
加里和我现在就在这里。

20:13.680 --> 20:15.615
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

20:15.682 --> 20:18.150
- Great! See ya there.
- 伟大的！再见。

20:18.217 --> 20:19.852
- [groans weakly]
- [微弱地呻吟]

20:19.919 --> 20:22.989
- Lady, you need a bath.
- 女士，你需要洗澡。

20:23.055 --> 20:25.224
- [moans]
- [呻吟]

20:25.292 --> 20:28.160
[lively music]
[活泼的音乐]

20:28.227 --> 20:30.430
- Yee-haw!
- 哎呀！

20:30.497 --> 20:32.565
- Contestant 24.
- 参赛者24。

20:32.632 --> 20:35.468
- Huh? Oh!
- 啊？哦！

20:35.535 --> 20:39.539
[laughs]
[笑]

20:39.606 --> 20:43.376
[barks]
[吠叫]

20:43.443 --> 20:45.445
His name is Rolly.
他的名字叫罗利。

20:45.512 --> 20:47.480
Isn't he pretty?
他不是很漂亮吗？

20:47.547 --> 20:50.583
- Hmm. What does it do?
- 唔。它有什么作用？

20:50.650 --> 20:54.287
- I'll show you.
- 我会告诉你。

20:54.354 --> 20:57.056
[groans, laughs]
[呻吟，大笑]

20:57.123 --> 21:03.730
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

21:07.199 --> 21:11.504
- Whoo! Go, Patrick, go!
Whoo!
- 呼！走吧，帕特里克，走吧！
呼！

21:11.571 --> 21:13.340
- [meows]
- Whoo!
- [喵]
- 呼！

21:13.406 --> 21:15.274
Go, Patrick, go!
走吧，帕特里克，走吧！

21:15.342 --> 21:18.778
[all yelping]
[全都尖叫]

21:22.181 --> 21:24.083
- Ta-da!
- 哒哒！

21:24.150 --> 21:26.553
- Well, it seems
every other contestant
- 嗯，看来
其他所有参赛者

21:26.619 --> 21:29.356
has been eliminated.
已被淘汰。

21:29.422 --> 21:32.058
- I suppose you win...
- 我想你赢了...

21:32.124 --> 21:34.594
by default.
默认情况下。

21:34.661 --> 21:39.065
- We... did it!
- 我们...做到了！

21:39.131 --> 21:41.267
Rolly, you're the best rock...
罗利，你是最好的摇滚......

21:42.902 --> 21:47.173
- Ever!
[cackles]
- 曾经！
[咯咯笑]

21:47.239 --> 21:50.743
Finally, your crystalline cache
is all mine.
最后，你的水晶缓存
都是我的。

21:52.445 --> 21:55.715
[curious mystical music]
[好奇的神秘音乐]

21:55.782 --> 21:57.484
- Rolly!
- 罗利！

21:57.550 --> 22:01.388
Oh, no!
哦，不！

22:03.089 --> 22:06.926
- Ooh.
[pants excitedly]
- 哦。
[兴奋地裤子]

22:08.495 --> 22:10.597
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

22:10.663 --> 22:13.800
- Oh.
G-g-good show, old chap.
- 哦。
干、干、干得好，老伙计。

22:13.866 --> 22:16.436
- [bellows]
- [怒吼]

22:16.503 --> 22:18.471
- Oh, fiddlesticks.
- 哦，小提琴。

22:18.538 --> 22:19.539
- Rolly.
- 罗利。

22:19.606 --> 22:22.241
I love your new look.
我喜欢你的新面貌。

22:22.308 --> 22:24.310
- Mmm.
- 嗯。

22:24.377 --> 22:25.912
- Aww.
- 哇。

22:25.978 --> 22:29.315
So Rolly was an egg all along.
所以罗利一直都是个蛋。

22:29.382 --> 22:30.382
- [meows]
- [喵]

22:30.417 --> 22:33.252
- Rawr.
- Oh!
- 罗尔。
- 哦！

22:33.319 --> 22:34.521
- Wow!
- 哇！

22:34.587 --> 22:39.058
Now that's what I call a pet!
这就是我所说的宠物！

22:39.125 --> 22:42.128
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

22:42.194 --> 22:44.063
[burps]
[打嗝]

22:44.130 --> 22:45.130
- Yay!
- 耶！

22:46.499 --> 22:48.935
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

22:49.001 --> 22:56.142
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪